---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ProjectCarousel from "../components/projects/ProjectsCarousel.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="w-full">
    <section class="w-full py-24 bg-slate-50 px-6">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <span
          class="text-brand-primary font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-2 block"
        >
          Research Area
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-secondary mb-6">
          Health Informatics & Dementia Care
        </h1>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-slate-700 font-medium mb-8">
          Innovating for better patient care and medical efficiency
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Our research lies at the convergence of healthcare, computer science, and 
          information science. Our primary objective is to optimize the use of data 
          to improve the well-being of People with Dementia (PwD) and support their 
          caregivers, as well as to enhance healthcare delivery. We design and build 
          computing systems to acquire and manage patient and caregivers’ data (e.g., mobile apps and IoT systems for patient monitoring). 
          We analyze this data to identify longitudinal patterns that facilitate the prediction of disease progression and tailor personalized 
          treatments, for example. We adhere to User-Centered Design (UCD) methodologies, validating our technological tools through rigorous 
          usability testing to ensure clinical relevance and successful adoption in real-world scenarios.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ProjectCarousel title="Related Projects" filterTag="Healthcare" />

    <div class="h-16"></div>

  </main>
</Layout>